<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <OutputType>Exe</OutputType>
    <TargetFramework>net8.0</TargetFramework>
    <RestorePackagesWithLockFile>true</RestorePackagesWithLockFile>
    <Nullable>disable</Nullable>
    <AssemblyName>Ronin</AssemblyName>
    <RootNamespace>Ronin</RootNamespace>
    <EnforceCodeStyleInBuild>true</EnforceCodeStyleInBuild>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(Platform)'=='Debug|AnyCPU'">
    <NoWarn>1701;1702;S1135;S1125;S3267;S3218;S1168;S907;S1125</NoWarn>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(Platform)'=='Release|AnyCPU'">
    <NoWarn>1701;1702;S1135;S1125;S3267;S3218;S1168;S907;S1125</NoWarn>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <!--
    Documentation. CS1570 is malformed XML and is an ERROR, because it is a real
    defect that was invisible: the maintained build generated no documentation
    file, so nothing ever read the comments and two broken nests sat there until
    an audit went looking with a flag nobody uses.

    The rest are suppressed for now and are their own cleanup, listed with what
    they cost today so the size of that job is written down rather than
    rediscovered:

      1591  missing XML comment for a visible member   1526
      1573  a parameter with no matching param tag       44
      1574  a cref that does not resolve                  8
      1734  a param name that matches no parameter        6
       419  an ambiguous cref                             4

    1574, 1734 and 419 are wrong references rather than absent ones, so they are
    the half of that list worth doing first.
  -->
  <PropertyGroup>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <NoWarn>$(NoWarn);1591;1573;1574;1734;419</NoWarn>
    <WarningsAsErrors>$(WarningsAsErrors);1570</WarningsAsErrors>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <AssemblyAttribute Include="System.Runtime.CompilerServices.InternalsVisibleTo">
      <_Parameter1>Ronin.Test</_Parameter1>
    </AssemblyAttribute>
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <AssemblyAttribute Include="System.Runtime.CompilerServices.InternalsVisibleTo">
      <_Parameter1>Ronin.Test2</_Parameter1>
    </AssemblyAttribute>
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <AssemblyAttribute Include="System.Runtime.CompilerServices.InternalsVisibleTo">
      <_Parameter1>Ronin.Scratch</_Parameter1>
    </AssemblyAttribute>
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <AssemblyAttribute Include="System.Runtime.CompilerServices.InternalsVisibleTo">
      <_Parameter1>Ronin.Server</_Parameter1>
    </AssemblyAttribute>
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
